      "title": {
        "ja": "自分を描く",
        "en": "Painting the Self"
      },
      "note": {
        "ja": "鏡を見ながら描いた顔は、いちばん正直で、いちばん嘘をつきます。",
        "en": "A face painted from a mirror is the most honest and the most deceptive of all."
      },
